<title id="title">Duration value</title><desc id="desc">Duration value. Render an integer and its explicit time unit together in timing, period, timeout or state-timer labels.</desc>
<g font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" stroke-width="1.5">
<rect x="0" y="0" width="560" height="280" rx="0" fill="#ffffff" stroke="none"/>
