<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1100" height="1040" viewBox="0 0 1100 1040" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
<title id="title">One component concept, from architecture to behavior</title>
<desc id="desc">Components own child components, private data, functions and ports. Functions own calculations and flow or states. Solid arrows show ownership; dashed arrows show references. Requirements and cases describe intent; all views project the same model.</desc>
