<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1080" height="675" viewBox="0 0 1080 675" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
<title id="title">5 Â· Read the resulting software structure</title>
<desc id="desc">All four cards are immediate children of WebShop::Production. Named connectors join the shown owned ports; component cards expose their delegated component child.</desc>
<g font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif">
<rect x="0" y="0" width="1080" height="675" rx="0" fill="white" stroke="none"/>
<polyline points="255,40 255,8 825,8 825,40" fill="none" stroke="#087f8c" stroke-width="2"/>
